## Performance

<a id="recursive-walks-join-on-link-alone"></a>
### recursive-walks-join-on-link-alone

-- SOURCE-ONLY REVIEW: not executed by Codex.
-- Run as the owner on a fresh clone of tally with frozen r1 applied.
